    "title": "Possibility in confidenceand cognition",
    "section": "Signal discrimination",
    "text": "Signal discrimination\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\[ s \\in [{\\color{s1} s_1}, {\\color{s2} s_2}] \\] \\[ x \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_s, I_2) \\] \\[ a = \\mathop{\\mathrm{argmax}}_{i \\in \\{ 1,2\\}} P(s_i \\;\\vert\\; x) \\] \\[ c = P(s_a \\;\\vert\\; x) \\]\n\n\n\\[ s \\in [{\\color{s1} s_1}, {\\color{s2} s_2}] \\] \\[ x \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_s, I_2) \\] \\[ a = \\mathop{\\mathrm{argmax}}_{i \\in \\{ 1,2\\}} P(s_i \\;\\vert\\; x) \\] \\[ c = \\textrm{logit}^{-1}\\left(\\lvert {\\color{s1} x_1} - {\\color{s2}\nx_2} \\rvert\\right) \\]"
  },
  {
    "objectID": "_slides/index.html#signal-detection",
    "href": "_slides/index.html#signal-detection",
    "title": "Possibility in confidenceand cognition",
    "section": "Signal detection",
    "text": "Signal detection\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\\[ p \\in [{\\color{p0} p_0}, {\\color{p1} p_1}] \\] \\[ s \\in [{\\color{p0} s_0}, {\\color{s1} s_1}, {\\color{s2} s_2}] \\] \\[ x \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_s, I_2) \\] \\[ a = \\mathop{\\mathrm{argmax}}_{i \\in \\{ 0,1\\}} P(p_i \\;\\vert\\; x) \\] \\[ c = P(p_a \\;\\vert\\; x) \\]\n\n\n\\[ p \\in [{\\color{p0} p_0}, {\\color{p1} p_1}] \\] \\[ s \\in [{\\color{p0} s_0}, {\\color{s1} s_1}, {\\color{s2} s_2}] \\] \\[ x \\sim \\mathcal{N}(\\mu_s, I_2) \\] \\[ a = \\mathop{\\mathrm{argmax}}_{i \\in \\{ 0,1\\}} P(p_i \\;\\vert\\; x) \\] \\[ c \\approx f\\left(\\textrm{max}\\left({\\color{s1} x_1}, {\\color{s2} x_2}\\right)\\right) \\]"
